      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i added those and it still isnt working lol. i checked the bucket policy too and it looks okay. wait i just realized i might be missing something about how the lambda actually assumes the role. do you think it could be a permission issue with the role itself or is it something else in the json? i'll paste the role policy too if that helps.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
